<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>More on <span id="A2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">PathConv</span></h2>

<div id="A2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Algorithm <a href="#algorithm2" title="In B.1 Path Sampling Strategy ‣ Appendix B More on PathConv ‣ All Roads Lead to Rome: Graph-Based Confidence Estimation for Large Language Model Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a> outlines a randomized method that traverses the graph from <math id="A2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Q" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>Q</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q</annotation></semantics></math> up to a maximum path length <math id="A2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>L</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L</annotation></semantics></math>, sampling <math id="A2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="M" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>M</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M</annotation></semantics></math> paths and accumulating weighted counts for each candidate answer <math id="A2.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="A_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
<section id="A2.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">B.1 </span>Path Sampling Strategy</h3>

<figure id="algorithm2" class="ltx_float ltx_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="algorithm2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 2</span> </span>Path Sampling for Approximating Weighted Path Counts</figcaption>
<div id="algorithm2.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_lst_numbers_left ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="algorithm2.4.1" class="ltx_listingline">
<span id="algorithm2.4.1.1" class="ltx_text"><span id="algorithm2.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Input:</span> </span>Graph <math id="algorithm2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{G}=(\mathcal{V},\mathcal{E})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒢</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒱</mi><mo>,</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{G}=(\mathcal{V},\mathcal{E})</annotation></semantics></math>, question node <math id="algorithm2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Q" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>Q</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q</annotation></semantics></math>, candidate answer <math id="algorithm2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="A_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>, sample size <math id="algorithm2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="M" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>M</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M</annotation></semantics></math>, maximum path length <math id="algorithm2.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>L</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L</annotation></semantics></math>, attenuation factor <math id="algorithm2.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma\in(0,1)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma\in(0,1)</annotation></semantics></math>
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.2" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.2.1" class="ltx_text"><span id="algorithm2.4.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Output:</span> </span>Estimated weighted path count <math id="algorithm2.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\widehat{P}(Q\to A_{i})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>P</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\widehat{P}(Q\to A_{i})</annotation></semantics></math>
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.3" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">1</span></span>
            Initialize accumulator <math id="algorithm2.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C\leftarrow 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C\leftarrow 0</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.4" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">2</span></span>
            <span id="algorithm2.4.4.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> <em id="algorithm2.4.4.3" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic"><math id="algorithm2.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m\leftarrow 1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m\leftarrow 1</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="algorithm2.4.4.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold ltx_font_upright">to</span> <math id="algorithm2.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="M" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>M</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M</annotation></semantics></math></em> <span id="algorithm2.4.4.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.5" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">3</span></span>
            Set current node <math id="algorithm2.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="v\leftarrow Q" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">v\leftarrow Q</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.6" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">4</span></span>
            Set path weight <math id="algorithm2.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="w\leftarrow 1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">w\leftarrow 1</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.7" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">5</span></span>
            <span id="algorithm2.4.7.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> <em id="algorithm2.4.7.3" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic"><math id="algorithm2.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ell\leftarrow 1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ell\leftarrow 1</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="algorithm2.4.7.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold ltx_font_upright">to</span> <math id="algorithm2.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>L</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L</annotation></semantics></math></em> <span id="algorithm2.4.7.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.8" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.8.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">6</span></span>
            <span id="algorithm2.4.8.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span> <math id="algorithm2.m15" class="ltx_Math" alttext="v=A_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">v=A_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="algorithm2.4.8.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">then</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.9" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.9.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">7</span></span>
             <math id="algorithm2.m16" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C\leftarrow C+w" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>w</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C\leftarrow C+w</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.10" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.10.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">8</span></span>
             <span id="algorithm2.4.10.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">break</span> the current sample;
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.11" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.11.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">9</span></span>
            Obtain successor set <math id="algorithm2.m17" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{N}(v)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{N}(v)</annotation></semantics></math> from <math id="algorithm2.m18" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{G}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒢</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{G}</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.12" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.12.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">10</span></span>
            <span id="algorithm2.4.12.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span> <math id="algorithm2.m19" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{N}(v)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{N}(v)</annotation></semantics></math> is empty <span id="algorithm2.4.12.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">then break</span>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.13" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.13.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">11</span></span>
            Sample a node <math id="algorithm2.m20" class="ltx_Math" alttext="v^{\prime}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>v</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">v^{\prime}</annotation></semantics></math> uniformly from <math id="algorithm2.m21" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{N}(v)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{N}(v)</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.14" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.14.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">12</span></span>
            Update path weight: <math id="algorithm2.m22" class="ltx_Math" alttext="w\leftarrow w\times\gamma" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">w\leftarrow w\times\gamma</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.15" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.15.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">13</span></span>
            Set <math id="algorithm2.m23" class="ltx_Math" alttext="v\leftarrow v^{\prime}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><msup><mi>v</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">v\leftarrow v^{\prime}</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.16" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.16.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">14</span></span>
            <span id="algorithm2.4.16.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">return</span> <math id="algorithm2.m24" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\widehat{P}(Q\to A_{i})\leftarrow\frac{C}{M}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>P</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mfrac><mi>C</mi><mi>M</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\widehat{P}(Q\to A_{i})\leftarrow\frac{C}{M}</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.17" class="ltx_listingline">
</div>
</div>
</figure>
<div id="A2.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The estimated weighted confidence for each answer <math id="A2.SS1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="A_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> is then incorporated into the overall normalization:</p>
<table id="A2.Ex7" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A2.Ex7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\text{Conf}(A_{i})=\frac{\widehat{P}(Q\to A_{i})}{\sum_{A_{j}\in\mathcal{A^{\prime}}}\widehat{P}(Q\to A_{j})}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>Conf</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>P</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow></msub><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>P</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{Conf}(A_{i})=\frac{\widehat{P}(Q\to A_{i})}{\sum_{A_{j}\in\mathcal{A^{\prime}}}\widehat{P}(Q\to A_{j})}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A2.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">B.2 </span>Avoiding Loops</h3>

<div id="A2.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In our experiments, we observe that loops occasionally appear in the graphs (less than 5% of cases). This is mainly due to misjudgments in equivalence checking. In such cases, we remove the loops by discarding certain inter-edges in the loops.</p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A3" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix C </span>Experiment Details</h2>

<div id="A3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We use vLLM <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib13" title="" class="ltx_ref">Kwon et al., 2023</a>)</cite> for all model inference.
To find equivalent steps, we prompt a Llama-3-8B-Instruct with temperature 0.</p>
</div>
<div id="A3.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.p2.1" class="ltx_p">For path generation, we use the temperature 1 with 3-shot in-context learning. We generate 10 additional samples for graph construction or consistency calculation. For fairness comparison, for p(ture) and Self-Verb, we directly ask the model whether each sampled answer is correct. For consistency-based methods, if the answer does not appear in the samples, it will be given a confidence 0.
For all methods, the output scores are normalized to the range <math id="A3.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="[0,1]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math> before computing ECE and Brier Score.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A4" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix D </span>Hyperparameters </h2>

<section id="A4.SS0.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Setup.</h5>

<div id="A4.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Here we report the ablations conducted with <span id="A4.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Llama-3-8B</span> on <span id="A4.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">MATH500</span>. Our default settings are <math id="A4.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha{=}0.1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha{=}0.1</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A4.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N{=}10" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N{=}10</annotation></semantics></math> sampled traces, and <math id="A4.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L{=}12" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L{=}12</annotation></semantics></math> maximum path length.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A4.SS0.SSSx1" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection">Attenuation Factor <math id="A4.SS0.SSSx1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>α</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha</annotation></semantics></math> (for CENCONF)</h4>

<div id="A4.SS0.SSSx1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.SS0.SSSx1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A4.T5" title="Table 5 ‣ Attenuation Factor 𝛼 (for CENCONF) ‣ Appendix D Hyperparameters ‣ All Roads Lead to Rome: Graph-Based Confidence Estimation for Large Language Model Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a> shows that <math id="A4.SS0.SSSx1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha{=}0.1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha{=}0.1</annotation></semantics></math> yields the best AUROC with a favorable ECE, validating our default.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A4.T5" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 5: </span>Ablation on attenuation factor <math id="A4.T5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>α</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha</annotation></semantics></math> (CENCONF).</figcaption>
