<section id="A4.SS0.SSSx2" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection">Number of Sampled Traces <math id="A4.SS0.SSSx2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math> (for PATHWEIGHT)</h4>

<div id="A4.SS0.SSSx2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.SS0.SSSx2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Increasing <math id="A4.SS0.SSSx2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math> improves performance with diminishing returns (Table <a href="#A4.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ Number of Sampled Traces 𝑁 (for PATHWEIGHT) ‣ Appendix D Hyperparameters ‣ All Roads Lead to Rome: Graph-Based Confidence Estimation for Large Language Model Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>). <math id="A4.SS0.SSSx2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N{=}10" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N{=}10</annotation></semantics></math> provides a strong cost–performance trade-off and is used as default.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A4.T6" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 6: </span>Sensitivity to the number of sampled traces <math id="A4.T6.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math> (PATHWEIGHT).</figcaption>
<table id="A4.T6.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="A4.T6.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A4.T6.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_th_row ltx_border_tt"><math id="A4.T6.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math></th>
<th id="A4.T6.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt"><span id="A4.T6.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">AUROC (%)</span></th>
<th id="A4.T6.2.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt"><span id="A4.T6.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">ECE (%)</span></th></tr>
